### Listar reservas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservas

### Crear reserva (ajusta laboratorioId según el catálogo)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{"laboratorioId":1,"solicitante":"Juan Pablo Correa Tarazona","inicio":"2030-06-15T09:00:00","fin":"2030-06-15T10:00:00"}

### Consultar una reserva
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/1

### Cancelar sin borrar el registro
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/1
